<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Oil Co Australia yr net profit rises.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Oil Co Australia yr net profit rises.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-09-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ended June 30</p>
<p>	    (million A$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Operating profit		29.68 vs 27.45</p>
<p>    Net profit			18.19 vs 16.24</p>
<p>    Sales			     66.30 vs 61.68</p>
<p>    Final dividend (cents)	 3.00 vs  3.00</p>
<p>NOTE: Oil Company of Australia Ltd is 85 percent owned by Boral Ltd.</p>
<p>-- Sydney newsroom 61-2 9373-1800</p>
</text>
